FTX+AAI+++BUSINESS MODEL: Pure B2B wholesaler supplying authorized European retailers. We act as the professional link between Asian manufacturing and EU retail channels. Direct-to-consumer sales are deliberately excluded to protect retailer margins and comply with distribution agreements — standard practice in international electronics wholesale.'
